# Copy this file to .env and fill in values if/when needed.
# Nothing in the current pipeline requires any of these — the fraud
# score itself is a deterministic tabular ML model, never an LLM call.
# This is only a placeholder for the OPTIONAL later step of turning
# rule-based explanation bullets into nicer prose. The explanation
# layer must degrade gracefully (plain rule-based text) if this is unset.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Override if your data pack lives somewhere other than ./data
# KESTREL_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data
